### ============================================
### Health & Info
### ============================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### API Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/api

### ============================================
### Authentication
### ============================================

### DEV LOGIN - Create test user and get JWT (disabled in production)
### Use this to get a token for testing authenticated endpoints
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Google OAuth (send token from Flutter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "google-id-token-from-flutter"
}

### Apple OAuth (send token from Flutter)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/apple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "apple-id-token-from-flutter",
  "fullName": {
    "givenName": "John",
    "familyName": "Doe"
  }
}

### Get Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### Households
### ============================================

### Create Household (with hemisphere for seasonal calculations)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/households
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Depto",
  "hemisphere": "south"
}

### Get Household
# @householdId = paste-household-id-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/households/{{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generate Invite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/households/{{householdId}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expiresInDays": 7
}

### Join Household with Invite
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/households/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inviteCode": "YDGP8447"
}

### Update Household Settings (name, hemisphere)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/households/{{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hemisphere": "south"
}

### Update Member Income
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/households/{{householdId}}/members/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "income": 50000.00
}

### ============================================
### Boards
### ============================================

### List Boards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Board
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "name": "Travel Ideas"
}

### Get Board with Items
# @boardId = paste-board-id-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add Link to Board
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}/items/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/article",
  "title": "Interesting Article"
}

### Add Photo to Board (use curl - see comment below)
# curl -X POST "https://nuestra-app-back-production.up.railway.app/api/boards/{{boardId}}/items/photo" \
#   -H "Authorization: Bearer {{token}}" \
#   -F "photo=@/path/to/your/image.jpg" \
#   -F "title=My Photo" \
#   -F "description=Photo description"

### Delete Board
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/boards/{{boardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### Recipes
### ============================================

@recipeId = 8e92bb93-33a2-4d7e-adca-20624cda7b30

### List Recipes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Recipes with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes?householdId={{householdId}}&search=pasta
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Recipe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "title": "Pasta Carbonara",
  "ingredients": [
    { "name": "Spaghetti", "quantity": 400, "unit": "g" },
    { "name": "Pancetta", "quantity": 200, "unit": "g" },
    { "name": "Egg", "quantity": 4, "unit": "units" },
    { "name": "Parmesan", "quantity": 100, "unit": "g" }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Boil water and cook pasta al dente",
    "Fry pancetta until crispy",
    "Mix eggs with grated parmesan",
    "Combine hot pasta with pancetta, remove from heat",
    "Add egg mixture and toss quickly"
  ],
  "servings": 4
}

### Create Recipe WITH ALTERNATIVES (can swap ingredients when adding to menu)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "title": "Roasted Chicken",
  "ingredients": [
    {
      "name": "Chicken",
      "quantity": 1.5,
      "unit": "kg",
      "alternatives": [
        { "name": "Beef roast", "quantity": 1.5, "unit": "kg" },
        { "name": "Pork loin", "quantity": 1.5, "unit": "kg" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Potato",
      "quantity": 6,
      "unit": "units",
      "alternatives": [
        { "name": "Sweet potato", "quantity": 4, "unit": "units" },
        { "name": "Butternut squash", "quantity": 1, "unit": "unit" }
      ]
    },
    { "name": "Rosemary", "quantity": 2, "unit": "sprigs" },
    { "name": "Garlic", "quantity": 4, "unit": "cloves" },
    { "name": "Olive oil", "quantity": 3, "unit": "tbsp" }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C",
    "Season chicken with salt, pepper, and rosemary",
    "Cut potatoes and toss with olive oil and garlic",
    "Roast chicken for 1 hour, add potatoes halfway through",
    "Rest for 10 minutes before serving"
  ],
  "servings": 4
}

### Create Seasonal Recipe (with seasonal vegetables)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "title": "Tomato Basil Salad",
  "ingredients": [
    { "name": "Tomato", "quantity": 4, "unit": "units" },
    { "name": "Basil", "quantity": 1, "unit": "bunch" },
    { "name": "Onion", "quantity": 1, "unit": "unit" },
    { "name": "Olive oil", "quantity": 3, "unit": "tbsp" }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Slice tomatoes",
    "Chop basil leaves",
    "Slice onion thinly",
    "Combine and drizzle with olive oil"
  ],
  "servings": 2
}

### Get Recipe (includes seasonality info)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Recipe
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pasta Carbonara Classic",
  "servings": 6
}

### Delete Recipe
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Seasonal Vegetables (shows what's in season now)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/seasonal-vegetables?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ============================================
### Menu Planner (Flexible Date-Based)
### ============================================

### List Menu Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menus?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Upcoming Menu Items (default: next 7 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/upcoming?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Upcoming Menu Items (custom date range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/upcoming?householdId={{householdId}}&from=2026-01-06&to=2026-01-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Menu Plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menus
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "name": "Week of Jan 6"
}

### Get Menu Plan by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete Menu Plan
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add Menu Item (recipe to specific date/meal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
  "date": "2026-01-06",
  "mealType": "dinner"
}

### Add Menu Item WITH SUBSTITUTION (swap an ingredient)
### Example: Recipe has "Chicken" but we want "Beef" instead
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipeId": "{{recipeId}}",
  "date": "2026-01-07",
  "mealType": "lunch",
  "substitutions": {
    "Chicken": { "name": "Beef", "quantity": 1, "unit": "kg" },
    "Tomato": { "name": "Bell Pepper", "quantity": 2, "unit": "units" }
  }
}

### Update Menu Item (move to different date/meal)
@menuItemId = paste-menu-item-id-here
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/items/{{menuItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-01-08",
  "mealType": "lunch"
}

### Update Menu Item with substitution changes
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/items/{{menuItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "substitutions": {
    "Spaghetti": { "name": "Penne", "quantity": 400, "unit": "g" }
  }
}

### Clear substitutions from menu item (use original recipe)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/items/{{menuItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "substitutions": null
}

### Delete Menu Item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/items/{{menuItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generate Shopping List from Menu (creates wishlist items!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/menus/{{menuPlanId}}/generate-shopping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "servingsMultiplier": 1.0
}

### ============================================
### Wishlists
### ============================================

@wishlistCategoryId = paste-category-id-here
@wishlistItemId = paste-item-id-here

### --- Categories ---

### List Wishlist Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/categories?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Wishlist Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "name": "Gift Ideas",
  "sortOrder": 10
}

### Update Wishlist Category
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/categories/{{wishlistCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Birthday Gifts",
  "sortOrder": 5
}

### Delete Wishlist Category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/categories/{{wishlistCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Items ---

### List Wishlist Items (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Wishlist Items (by category)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists?householdId={{householdId}}&categoryId={{wishlistCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Wishlist Items (unchecked only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists?householdId={{householdId}}&checked=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Wishlist Items (personal only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists?householdId={{householdId}}&ownerType=personal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Wishlist Items (shared only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists?householdId={{householdId}}&ownerType=shared
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Wishlist Item (shared)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{wishlistCategoryId}}",
  "name": "Olive Oil",
  "quantity": 1,
  "unit": "bottle",
  "ownerType": "shared"
}

### Create Wishlist Item (personal - visible to household for gift ideas)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{wishlistCategoryId}}",
  "name": "New Headphones",
  "url": "https://example.com/headphones",
  "price": 150.00,
  "preferenceEmoji": "🎧",
  "ownerType": "personal"
}

### Toggle Item Checked
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/{{wishlistItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checked": true
}

### Update Wishlist Item
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/{{wishlistItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Extra Virgin Olive Oil",
  "quantity": 2
}

### Delete Wishlist Item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/{{wishlistItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clear All Checked Items (household-wide)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/clear-checked?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clear Checked Items (specific category)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/clear-checked?householdId={{householdId}}&categoryId={{wishlistCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Bulk Create Items (for programmatic use)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/wishlists/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{wishlistCategoryId}}",
  "items": [
    { "name": "Milk", "quantity": 2, "unit": "liters" },
    { "name": "Bread", "quantity": 1, "unit": "loaf" },
    { "name": "Eggs", "quantity": 12, "unit": "units" }
  ]
}

### ============================================
### Expenses
### ============================================

@expenseCategoryId = paste-expense-category-id-here
@expenseId = paste-expense-id-here

### --- Categories ---

### List Expense Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/categories?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Expense Category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "name": "Groceries",
  "icon": "🛒"
}

### Update Expense Category
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/categories/{{expenseCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Supermarket",
  "icon": "🛒"
}

### Delete Expense Category
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/categories/{{expenseCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Expenses ---

### List Expenses (all)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?householdId={{householdId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Expenses (by month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?householdId={{householdId}}&month=1&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Expenses (unsettled only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?householdId={{householdId}}&settled=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Expenses (by category)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses?householdId={{householdId}}&categoryId={{expenseCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Expense (splits calculated automatically!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "description": "Weekly groceries",
  "amount": 15000.00,
  "currency": "ARS",
  "date": "2026-01-07",
  "categoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}"
}

### Get Expense by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update Expense
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Monthly groceries",
  "amount": 20000.00
}

### Delete Expense
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### --- Settlements ---

### Settle Single Expense (all splits)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/settle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settled": true
}

### Settle Single User's Split
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/settle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "settled": true
}

### Unsettle an Expense
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/{{expenseId}}/settle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "settled": false
}

### Settle All Expenses in Period (mid-month settlement!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/settle-period
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "householdId": "{{householdId}}",
  "fromDate": "2026-01-01",
  "toDate": "2026-01-15"
}

### --- Summary ---

### Get Expense Summary (current month)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/summary?householdId={{householdId}}&month=1&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Expense Summary (whole year)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/summary?householdId={{householdId}}&year=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get Expense Summary (unsettled only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses/summary?householdId={{householdId}}&month=1&year=2026&settledOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

